CC0 covers BrushCodex's own contribution: the identifiers, the record shape and
the compilation. It cannot and does not relicense anything a manufacturer holds —
product names and printed codes are the manufacturers' own, and this dedication
grants no trademark rights in them. A record appears here only where an explicit
publication decision permits it; see README.md.

